        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"grid-based-calibration-refinement-for-openptv\">Grid-Based Calibration Refinement for OpenPTV</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This notebook performs bundle adjustment calibration refinement using a planar grid target.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Workflow:</strong></span>\n<ol>\n<li>Load PyPTV experiment parameters from YAML file</li>\n<li>Load calibration images and initial calibration</li>\n<li>Detect grid points using OpenCV</li>\n<li>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Optimize camera exterior orientation using geometric constraints:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Planarity</strong>: All grid points lie on a single plane</li>\n<li><strong>Distance</strong>: Adjacent points at known spacing (e.g., 120 mm)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This is analogous to dumbbell calibration but uses a planar grid with multiple constraints.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
